00:33:37,849 --> 00:33:38,725
Are you doodling?

861
00:33:39,475 --> 00:33:41,978
I just drew
how we'll move to the mountain.

862
00:33:42,061 --> 00:33:43,438
I like drawing, so…

863
00:33:43,521 --> 00:33:44,814
-Draw more, then.
-Yes.

864
00:33:44,897 --> 00:33:46,566
-I drew one for each.
-This one too.

865
00:33:46,649 --> 00:33:47,650
The sunrise.

866
00:33:47,734 --> 00:33:49,068
That's our quest.

867
00:33:49,152 --> 00:33:52,864
