868
00:33:57,702 --> 00:34:03,958
DISHWASHER

869
00:34:11,090 --> 00:34:12,008
STILL PLANNING

870
00:34:12,091 --> 00:34:13,301
-Our plan is…
-Yes.

871
00:34:13,384 --> 00:34:15,386
We might get cold while we rest.

872
00:34:15,470 --> 00:34:17,055
-So taking short breaks often…
-Often?

873
00:34:17,138 --> 00:34:19,348
