00:50:46,752 --> 00:50:47,919
MOVING AGAIN

1241
00:50:48,003 --> 00:50:51,006
1 HOUR 38 MINUTES UNTIL SUNRISE

1242
00:50:52,174 --> 00:50:55,218
But still, it's better
than a stony, uphill trail.

1243
00:50:55,302 --> 00:50:57,804
