-Let's keep pace with him.
-He should take the lead.

1256
00:51:58,657 --> 00:51:59,658
Okay, I'll take the lead.

1257
00:51:59,741 --> 00:52:01,284
Yes, you can take your time.

1258
00:52:01,368 --> 00:52:02,202
