00:53:07,225 --> 00:53:09,477
Hey, should we take a break
around that curve?

1274
00:53:09,561 --> 00:53:11,771
-Sounds good. We'll rest right above it.
-Sure.

1275
00:53:13,106 --> 00:53:14,524
We'll rest right above the curve.

1276
00:53:14,608 --> 00:53:15,525
-Okay.
-Okay.

1277
00:53:19,321 --> 00:53:22,908
<i>"Let's take short breaks often."</i>

1278
00:53:22,991 --> 00:53:25,619
